<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Japan Power Market — JEPX Prices, Grid & Utilities · UtilityScope</title>
<meta name="description" content="Japan electricity market intelligence: JEPX day-ahead prices, OCCTO grid status, major utilities (TEPCO, Kansai, Chubu) and energy transition progress.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/style.css">
<style>
.market-hero {
  padding: 110px 0 56px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.market-hero-flag { font-size: 56px; margin-bottom: 16px; display: block; }
.price-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1px;
  background: var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.price-grid-cell {
  background: var(--bg2);
  padding: 22px 24px;
}
.cell-label {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text3);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.cell-value {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--text);
}
.cell-sub {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text3);
  margin-top: 4px;
}
.info-block {
  padding: 20px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.info-block:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.info-label {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text3);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.info-value {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--text);
  line-height: 1.55;
}
.transition-bar {
  height: 6px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  border-radius: 3px;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-top: 8px;
}
.transition-fill {
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: 3px;
  background: var(--teal);
}
.utility-row {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 14px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.utility-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="nav-placeholder"></div>
<main>

<!-- Hero -->
<div class="market-hero">
  <div class="page-wrap">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px">
      <div>
        <a href="../pages/markets.html" style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:1px">← ALL MARKETS</a>
        <div style="margin-top:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px">
          <span style="font-size:52px">🇯🇵</span>
          <div>
            <div class="section-kicker" style="margin-bottom:4px">JEPX · METI · OCCTO</div>
            <h1 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:42px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px">Japan</h1>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="color:var(--text2);font-size:15px;max-width:560px;margin-top:16px;line-height:1.65">Japan operates a liberalised electricity market through JEPX (Japan Electric Power Exchange). The grid is managed by OCCTO with regional TSOs. Ten major utilities serve distinct geographic zones.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start">
        <span class="badge badge-teal">Liberalised market</span>
        <span class="badge badge-green"><span class="dot dot-green"></span>Normal grid</span>
        <span class="badge badge-gray">Phase 1 coverage</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page-wrap">
  <section>
    <!-- Price grid -->
    <div class="section-kicker">Benchmark prices · 5 Jun 2026</div>
    <div class="price-grid mt-12">
      <div class="price-grid-cell">
        <div class="cell-label">Day-ahead (JEPX)</div>
        <div class="cell-value text-teal">¥18.4<span style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text3)">/kWh</span></div>
        <div class="cell-sub up">▲ 2.3% from yesterday</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price-grid-cell">
        <div class="cell-label">System price range</div>
        <div class="cell-value">¥12–26</div>
        <div class="cell-sub">kWh · 5 Jun</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price-grid-cell">
        <div class="cell-label">Retail benchmark (Tokyo)</div>
        <div class="cell-value">¥31.2<span style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text3)">/kWh</span></div>
        <div class="cell-sub">Regulated tariff · residential</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:10px;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--bg3);border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)">
      <p style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--text3)">
        <span style="color:var(--amber)">Note:</span> Prices updated manually by 09:00 SGT each weekday. Source: JEPX public data portal. JEPX publishes area prices for 9 regional blocs; figures above reflect the Tokyo (Tokyo Electric Power) area.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:32px;align-items:start">
      <!-- Main content -->
      <div>
        <div class="section-kicker">Market structure</div>
        <h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:26px;font-weight:700;margin:8px 0 24px">How Japan's electricity market works</h2>

        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:20px">
          <h3 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px">Market liberalisation</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.65">Japan completed full retail liberalisation in April 2016, allowing all consumers to choose their supplier. JEPX operates the wholesale spot market, with day-ahead, intraday and forward contracts. The market is overseen by METI (Ministry of Economy, Trade and Industry) with OCCTO managing cross-regional grid coordination.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:20px">
          <h3 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px">Grid structure</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.65">Japan's grid is split between 50 Hz (eastern Japan, including Tokyo) and 60 Hz (western Japan, including Osaka and Nagoya). This frequency barrier limits east-west power flows, making interconnection capacity a key market constraint. OCCTO manages the cross-regional interconnection capacity allocation process.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:14px;padding:14px;background:var(--bg3);border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text2)">
            <strong style="color:var(--text)">Current grid status:</strong> Normal — reserve margins tracking above 10% across all regional blocs. Hokkaido under tighter conditions due to cold snap demand.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px">Energy transition</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:14px">Japan's 6th Strategic Energy Plan targets 36–38% renewables by 2030 and 20–22% nuclear. The government reversed its post-Fukushima nuclear exit in 2022, with restarts proceeding at multiple sites. Offshore wind is emerging as a key growth area, with 10 GW targeted by 2030.</p>
          <div style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:6px">Renewable penetration (2025 estimate)</div>
          <div class="transition-bar"><div class="transition-fill" style="width:24%"></div></div>
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--text3);margin-top:4px"><span>Current: ~24%</span><span>2030 target: 36–38%</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <div>
        <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px">
          <div class="section-kicker" style="margin-bottom:16px">Market facts</div>
          <div class="info-block">
            <div class="info-label">Market operator</div>
            <div class="info-value">JEPX (Japan Electric Power Exchange)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="info-block">
            <div class="info-label">Grid regulator</div>
            <div class="info-value">OCCTO / METI</div>
          </div>
          <div class="info-block">
            <div class="info-label">Market type</div>
            <div class="info-value">Fully liberalised (2016)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="info-block">
            <div class="info-label">Installed capacity</div>
            <div class="info-value">~300 GW total</div>
          </div>
          <div class="info-block">
            <div class="info-label">Peak demand (2025)</div>
            <div class="info-value">~150 GW (summer peak)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="info-block">
            <div class="info-label">Nuclear capacity (operating)</div>
            <div class="info-value">~12 GW (12 reactors)</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="section-kicker" style="margin-bottom:16px">Key data sources</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text2)">
            <div>→ <a href="https://www.jepx.jp" target="_blank" style="color:var(--teal);text-decoration:none">JEPX official portal</a></div>
            <div>→ <a href="https://www.occto.or.jp" target="_blank" style="color:var(--teal);text-decoration:none">OCCTO grid data</a></div>
            <div>→ <a href="https://www.meti.go.jp" target="_blank" style="color:var(--teal);text-decoration:none">METI energy policy</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key utilities -->
  <section>
    <div class="section-kicker">Major operators</div>
    <h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:26px;font-weight:700;margin:8px 0 24px">Key utilities</h2>
    <div class="card" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden">
      <div style="padding:0 24px">
        <div class="utility-row">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:600;font-size:14px">TEPCO (Tokyo Electric Power Company)</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:3px">Kanto region · 37.7 GW capacity · Listed: TSE</div>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align:right">
            <div style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--teal)">50% RE by 2030</div>
            <a href="../utilities/tepco.html" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--teal);text-decoration:none;display:block;margin-top:4px">Profile →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="utility-row">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:600;font-size:14px">Kansai Electric Power (KEPCO)</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:3px">Kansai region · 28.9 GW · Listed: TSE · Nuclear-heavy</div>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align:right">
            <div style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--teal)">44% RE by 2030</div>
            <a href="../pages/utilities.html" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--teal);text-decoration:none;display:block;margin-top:4px">Directory →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="utility-row">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:600;font-size:14px">Chubu Electric Power</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:3px">Chubu region · 26.1 GW · Listed: TSE</div>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align:right">
            <div style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--teal)">40% RE by 2030</div>
            <a href="../pages/utilities.html" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--teal);text-decoration:none;display:block;margin-top:4px">Directory →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text3);margin-top:12px">10 regional utilities plus new entrants. <a href="../pages/utilities.html" style="color:var(--teal);text-decoration:none">View full utility directory →</a></p>
  </section>

  <!-- Newsletter CTA -->
  <section>
    <div style="background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border2);border-radius:10px;padding:40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px">
      <div>
        <h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">Get Japan market updates weekly</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--text2);font-size:14px">JEPX price trends, regulatory moves and utility news in your inbox every Friday.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="../pages/newsletter.html" class="btn btn-primary">Subscribe free →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
</main>
<div id="footer-placeholder"></div>
<script src="../js/nav.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
